  "reasoning": "The defendant produced and sold pickled vegetables using salt that lacked iodine, which is prohibited in iodine‑deficient regions by food safety regulations. This constitutes the crime of producing and selling food that does not meet food safety standards under Article 144 of the Criminal Law. No other criminal conduct is described.",
